            "review_title": "Review at Silvi Coffee Roasters",
            "review_text": "DLTT2015\nLondon, United Kingdom1007 contributions\n0\nCute and cosy Gluten free cafe outside the centre!\nFeb 2023 • Friends\nThe is a very cute and cosy gluten free cafe!\n\nWe did have to travel via taxi from the city centre to get to get here but we really enjoyed. It’s around £3 taxi from district 1.\n\nThere was a good selection on the menu including sandwiches, pancakes, cakes etc.\n\nThere were a few veggie options but the vegan options were limited. They did serve vegan pancakes and waffles. There were also dairy free cakes available.\n\nYou could get brunch for between 70-155k VND. Cakes were between 50-70k VND\n\nI had the cinnamon on Swirl which was yummy and my friend the tuna bagel which she thoroughly enjoyed. The caramel smoothie with oat milk was delicious! \n\nI would recommend going if you are GF and want a good breakie!\n\nNote they don’t accept visa.\nRead more\nWritten February 28, 2023",
