            "review_text": "TonyM277\nMelbourne, Australia126 contributions\n0\nA Gluten Free eaters paradise hidden away\nJan 2023 • Family\nGluten Free Gourmet / Silvi Coffee Roasters is a great little cafe tucked away in a back lane. A paradise for Gluten Free people - my 19 YO daughter loved the GF menu. We had GF burgers, GF Pizza and GF cakes. Top that off with the best espresso coffee in Vietnam and you will love it. We did!\nWritten January 14, 2023",
